        "2) Replacing the real string 'NaN' with a real, pandas recognized null\n",
        "3) Strip white space from every text column\n",
        "4) Converting numeric looking text columns to actual numbers\n",
        "5) Impute missing values (median for skewed numerics, mode for categories)"
      ]
